      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A prolonged period of illness in a patient showing symptoms of reflexdystrophy is described. After going through several examinations and finally being referred to a pain clinic the patient demanded a second opinion from an orthopaedic surgeon. Her symptoms turned out to have been caused by a compression syndrome of the anterior interosseus nerve."},
